Scenario ID: S01
Scenario title: Verification Test Setup and Reporting
Initial workflow description:
An engineer prepares a verification test, runs the evaluation, checks the results, and writes a short report. If something looks wrong, the engineer investigates and shares the result with related people.

Domain expert answers:
{
